{"id": "sevt_01C9sXPJD9jq7c5T3UPtd5oc", "input": {"command": "cd /mnt/session/uploads && ls -la app.log && grep -c 'db_query sql=\"SELECT \\* FROM order_items WHERE order_id = ?\"' app.log; grep -m3 'db_query' app.log; grep -o 'db_query[^]]*' app.log | head -0; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re,collections\nc=collections.Counter()\npat=re.compile(r'(\\d{4}-\\d\\d-\\d\\dT\\d\\d:\\d\\d)')\nwith open('app.log',errors='ignore') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        if 'order_items WHERE order_id = ?' in line:\n            m=pat.search(line)\n            if m: c[m.group(1)]+=1\nfor k in sorted(c): print(k,c[k])\nEOF"}, "name": "bash", "processed_at": "2026-10-14T12:01:16.677858Z", "type": "agent.tool_use", "evaluated_permission": "allow", "evaluation": {"type": "always_allow"}, "session_thread_id": null}
